   "scene": "recap",
   "text": "You were oxygen in the playground air. You were breathed in through the nose, down the windpipe, and into a tiny air sac."
  },
  {
   "id": "s1c",
   "scene": "recap",
   "text": "You passed into the blood, and a red blood cell carried you. The heart pumped you to a leg muscle, where you helped release energy from food."
  },
